.TH TARIA 1 "" "taria 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
taria \- a terminal chat client for Claude, OpenAI, Mistral and local models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B taria
[options] [prompt]
.br
.B taria
\-p "question" [options]
.br
.B taria
doctor
.br
.B taria
doctor clipboard
.br
.B taria
doctor repair
.br
.B taria
doctor merge
.br
.B taria
key set <provider>
.br
.B taria
key remove <provider>
.br
.B taria
key status <provider>
.br
.B taria
key remove\-old <provider>
.br
.B taria
completions <bash|zsh|fish>
.br
.B taria
man
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
taria streams answers from Claude, OpenAI, Mistral and local models (llama.cpp, Ollama, LM Studio, or any server that speaks the OpenAI chat\-completions protocol) in the terminal. Every conversation is written to disk as it happens. Inside taria, type
.B /help
for commands and keys.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-print\fR
Non\-interactive: stream the answer to stdout and exit.
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-model\fR \fIref\fR
Model as provider/model\-id.
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-system\fR \fItext\fR
System prompt.
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-continue\fR
Continue the most recent conversation.
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-resume\fR [\fIid\fR]
Resume a conversation (opens a picker without an id).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
With \-p: print one JSON object instead of text.
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fIname\fR
Dark, light, ansi or auto.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colour (NO_COLOR is honoured too).
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR [\fIfile\fR]
Log requests, responses and timings (keys redacted).
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show the version.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBtaria doctor\fR
Check terminal, clipboard, keychain and providers.
.TP
\fBtaria doctor clipboard\fR
Try a copy the way /copy does it.
.TP
\fBtaria doctor repair\fR
Repair conversations a crash in parley < 0.2.0 cut short.
.TP
\fBtaria doctor merge\fR
Copy conversations that are only in parley's old folder.
.TP
\fBtaria key set <provider>\fR
Store an API key in the keychain.
.TP
\fBtaria key remove <provider>\fR
Remove a stored key.
.TP
\fBtaria key status <provider>\fR
Show where the key for a provider comes from.
.TP
\fBtaria key remove\-old <provider>\fR
Remove parley's old keychain entry for a provider.
.TP
\fBtaria completions <bash|zsh|fish>\fR
Print a shell completion script.
.TP
\fBtaria man\fR
Print the man page (installed with the npm package).
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/taria/config.yaml\fR
Configuration (default \fI~/.config/taria/config.yaml\fR).
.TP
\fI$XDG_DATA_HOME/taria\fR
Conversations, input history, attachments (default \fI~/.local/share/taria\fR).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBANTHROPIC_API_KEY\fR, \fBOPENAI_API_KEY\fR, ...
API keys, read before the keychain and the credentials file.
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
Disable colour.
.TP
\fBTARIA_NO_KEYCHAIN\fR
Do not use the system keychain.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on an error, 2 for a usage error, 130 when interrupted.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/Riloative/taria
